<title>FRANCE: GAN to sell Belgium unit -- paper.</title>
<headline>GAN to sell Belgium unit -- paper.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>French insurer Groupe des Assurances Nationales (GAN) plans to sell its GAN Belgium unit before the end of the year, the L'Agefi newspaper said.</p>
<p>GAN, advised by investment bank J.P. Morgan, hopes to realise a 200 million franc asset gain on the sale, the newspaper said. The sale price would be some 500 to 600 million francs.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
